      "description": "First project-code read that creates vulnerability-relevant JPEG state: `get_sof()` pulls the component count from the recovered SOF header. For the staged witness this byte is `3`, which sizes the later `coef_bits` / `prev_coef_bits` tables and the all-component smoothing loops."
