        "left": "&coef_bits[1]",
        "right": "9 * sizeof(coef_bits[1])"
      },
      "verified": true,
      "verified_by": "a_change_dc_reads_uninitialized_prev_latch",
      "fine_trace_step": 11,
      "description": "MSAN sink. After `coef_bits` is redirected to the previous-scan latch for a later iMCU row, this `change_dc` test reads `coef_bits[1..9]`. For Cb/Cr on the witnessed path those latch entries carry the undefined `prev_coef_bits` values, producing the observed use-of-uninitialized-value at `jdcoefct.c:519`."
    },
